  "description": "Former actress Seon-Yeong is shocked when she finds out about her husband's affair with a younger woman. When a fortune teller says she needs to receive youthful energy from younger women to stop his cheating, the desperate Seon-Yeong concludes that she has to sleep with a younger woman to get what she wants. So when an innocent young housekeeper named Min-Seo comes to work for her, it's not long before their relationship takes a steamy turn...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Ridi's Jujonggwangye GL Danpyeonseon (주종관계 GL 단편선) Collection.*",
